      "type": "text",
      "x": 930,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "1. Find the next tick on each pool.\n2. Move to whichever comes first:\n    a tick, or the gap closing.\n3. Crossed a tick? Update liquidity, repeat.\nThe SOL added up is the best size.",
      "originalText": "1. Find the next tick on each pool.\n2. Move to whichever comes first:\n    a tick, or the gap closing.\n3. Crossed a tick? Update liquidity, repeat.\nThe SOL added up is the best size.",
